   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Coloured Solar Facades</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Coloured Solar Facades\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of the online aesthetic survey with the original design images: high-rise apartment blocks in Trondheim, Norway, whose facades and balcony railings are clad in coloured photovoltaic panels (FIPV) built from a pixelated NCS colour palette. Each set shows the same building in one main facade hue with three colour strategies side by side: A, the whole facade and all balcony railings in the main hue (monochromatic); B, part of the balcony railings in the complementary hue; C, all balcony railings in the complementary hue. As in the paper, participants first give their gender, age and experience with design or colour, then pick the design they prefer in each set. Rebuilt from Xiang & Matusiak (2022), Facade Integrated Photovoltaics design for high-rise buildings with balconies, balancing daylight, aesthetic and energy productivity performance, Journal of Building Engineering 57: 104950, with the design images from its Figs. 26, 27, 28 and 32 (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; each figure is shown whole and unchanged) and the survey from Sections 2.2.4 and 3.3. Image ids: y30r_small, y80r_small, g30y_small (Figs. 26-28, small balconies) and y80r_medium (Fig. 32, the paper's example survey question with medium balconies); the answer preferred holds A, B or C keyed by image id. Analysis as in the paper: share of participants choosing A, B and C in each hue series, compared between non-experts and experts (1-5 years or more than 5 years of design or colour experience). The paper (152 participants from several countries, 51% experts) found that B, with partial balcony railings in the complementary colour, was chosen most often in every hue series (38-45%), followed by the all-monochromatic A (31-38%) and the all-complementary C (17-30%), and that non-experts rated C higher than A, unlike experts, especially for the yellowish series. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper's survey ran on Google Forms and its full question list is not printed; only its choice task is rebuilt, and its 5-level rating (very good to very poor) is left out because the paper does not say which designs were rated; (2) the paper mixed small- and medium-balcony designs but prints medium-balcony sets only for the reddish series, so the yellowish and greenish series use small balconies; (3) the four sets appear in random order, and the question and answer wording is ours; (4) the experience question uses the paper's three groups; the gender options add 'other or prefer not to say'.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"designs\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other or prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 100\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"experience\",\n      \"title\": \"How much working experience do you have in design or colour?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"none\",\n        \"text\": \"None or limited\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1to5\",\n        \"text\": \"1-5 years\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"gt5\",\n        \"text\": \"More than 5 years\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"sets\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"preferred\",\n      \"title\": \"Which design do you prefer?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"A\",\n        \"text\": \"A\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"B\",\n        \"text\": \"B\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"C\",\n        \"text\": \"C\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"pv-original\">{\"source\": \"Xiang & Matusiak (2022) Journal of Building Engineering 57: 104950\", \"n\": 152, \"expertShare\": 0.51, \"sets\": [{\"id\": \"y30r_small\", \"label\": \"Yellowish facade (hue Y30R), small side balconies\", \"figure\": \"Fig. 26\"}, {\"id\": \"y80r_small\", \"label\": \"Reddish facade (hue Y80R), small side balconies\", \"figure\": \"Fig. 27\"}, {\"id\": \"g30y_small\", \"label\": \"Greenish facade (hue G30Y), small side balconies\", \"figure\": \"Fig. 28\"}, {\"id\": \"y80r_medium\", \"label\": \"Reddish facade (hue Y80R), medium side balconies\", \"figure\": \"Fig. 32\"}], \"options\": {\"A\": \"all monochromatic\", \"B\": \"partial balcony railings in complementary hue\", \"C\": \"all balcony railings in complementary hue\"}, \"result\": {\"A\": \"31-38%\", \"B\": \"38-45%\", \"C\": \"17-30%\"}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f2f1ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1d1b;--muted:#5d5c57;--accent:#2b5d7a;--line:#dad8d2;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#dce9f1}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\n.fig{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}\n.fig .in{min-width:640px}\n.fig img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.fig .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);padding:2px 0 6px}\n.hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}\n@media (min-width:700px){.hint{display:none}}\n.picks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\n.picks label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 6px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}\n.picks label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.picks input{display:none}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\n.q.miss,.picks.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:10px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.95rem}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;max-width:140px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Design images and survey: Xiang &amp; Matusiak (2022), Journal of Building Engineering 57: 104950, Figs. 26–28 and 32 (doi:10.1016/j.jobe.2022.104950, CC BY-NC-ND 4.0; figures shown unchanged).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='fipv-colour:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('pv-original').textContent), SETS=ORIG.sets;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));var t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(SETS.map(function(s){return s.id;})),i:0};}\n  function chs(q){return (q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return typeof c==='string'?{value:c,text:c}:c;});}\n  function radios(n){var q=Q[n];return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+chs(q).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function pick(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name='+n+']:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function bad(n,m){var el=app.querySelector('[data-q='+n+']');el.classList.add('miss');el.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});err(m||('Please answer: '+Q[n].title));}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Coloured solar panels on apartment blocks</h1><p>Solar panels can now be made in colours and used as facade cladding. You will see four sets of designs for a high-rise apartment block. In each set the building is the same and only the colours differ. Pick the design you like best. It takes about 3 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label></div><div class=\"card\">'+radios('gender')+\n     '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"age\"><b>'+esc(Q.age.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" id=\"age\" min=\"16\" max=\"100\"></div>'+radios('experience')+\n     '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var g=pick('gender');if(g==null)return bad('gender');\n      var a=document.getElementById('age').value.trim(),x=Number(a);if(!a||!(x>=16&&x<=100)||Math.round(x)!==x)return bad('age','Please enter your age as a whole number between 16 and 100.');\n      var e=pick('experience');if(e==null)return bad('experience');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true),SPSite.answer('gender',g),SPSite.answer('age',x),SPSite.answer('experience',e)],this,function(){st.step='sets';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function setPage(){\n    var id=st.order[st.i],s=SETS.filter(function(z){return z.id===id;})[0],f=files[id];\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Set '+(st.i+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><h2>'+esc(s.label)+'</h2>'+\n     '<div class=\"fig\"><div class=\"in\"><img alt=\"Three colour versions of the same apartment block\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\">'+(id==='y80r_medium'?'':'<div class=\"lab\"><span>A</span><span>B</span><span>C</span></div>')+'</div></div><p class=\"hint\">Swipe sideways to see all three designs.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><b>'+esc(Q.preferred.title)+'</b><div class=\"picks\" data-q=\"preferred\">'+['A','B','C'].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"preferred\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>'+\n     '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.i+1<st.order.length?'Next set':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var v=pick('preferred');if(v==null){var p=app.querySelector('.picks');p.classList.add('miss');return err('Please pick A, B or C.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('preferred',v,{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.i++;if(st.i>=st.order.length)st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){var o=fresh();st=o;save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function clr(e){var r=e.target.closest&&(e.target.closest('.picks')||e.target.closest('.q'));if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}}\n  app.addEventListener('change',clr);app.addEventListener('input',clr);\n  function route(){window.scrollTo(0,0);if(st.step==='sets')return setPage();if(st.step==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','gender','age','experience','preferred'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('designs')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=SETS.map(function(s){return s.id;}).filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"designs\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order&&st.order.length===SETS.length)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
