only its choice task is rebuilt, and its 5-level rating (very good to very poor) is left out because the paper does not say which designs were rated; (2) the paper mixed small- and medium-balcony designs but prints medium-balcony sets only for the reddish series, so the yellowish and greenish series use small balconies; (3) the four sets appear in random order, and the question and answer wording is ours; (4) the experience question uses the paper's three groups; the gender options add 'other or prefer not to say'.",
